title: 'Jeff Bezos, 2016 letter to shareholders: decide on about 70% of the information you wish you had; disagree and commit; escalate true misalignment early.'
pid: 9dd8e818-a7cc-43bc-8fdb-ad60a2201b37
body: |2-
  https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/company-news/2016-letter-to-shareholders
  Otherwise misalignment is settled by exhaustion: "You've worn me
  down" is an awful way to decide.
